  vendorName: Apprentice Thorne
  offerText: I beg of you, fund my independent research! It will cost you a fortune
    right now, and I have absolutely nothing to offer in return except my profound
    gratitude.
  acceptResultText: You hand over the large sum of cash. Thorne runs off without
    even writing a receipt. You feel like an absolute fool for giving away your money
    to a beggar.
  rejectResultText: You slam the door on the beggar. You feel quite sensible keeping
    your wealth strictly to yourself.
  acceptedDelayedText: Thorne returns in expensive clothes! His research was a massive
    success, and he brought you a staggering return on your investment out of sheer
    loyalty!
